{
  "schema": "hima-pdk-cards/4",
  "about": "The PDK cards of the analog-bandgap Pack: hima-pdk-cards/3 (the OTA Pack's) plus a vertical PNP (pnp), a poly resistor (res) and a capacitor (cap); every process corner lists the MOS, BJT, resistor and capacitor sections (BJT, resistor and capacitor follow the process corner; the cross corners sf/fs take their typical sections); mismatch lists the sections Monte Carlo adds (MOS become subcircuits with Pelgrom mismatch, so their instance prefix is X), with the switches it sets after the includes. supplies are the supply voltages every corner is simulated at; vdd is the characterization supply. avtMvUm is the per-device sigma(Vth) times sqrt(Weff Leff) in mV um, with Leff = L - dlUm and Weff = W - dwUm.",
